WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.387
XGEN-JING wired up two more control axes, four days later.

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:07.822
What sits behind those six numbers.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.026
Camera-control dimensions the parser fills.

00:00:11.026 --> 00:00:15.032
2 of 6: live at the 17 September release.

00:00:15.032 --> 00:00:18.149
4 of 6: live after commit cbeec31.

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:21.265
Ty and roll are still literal zeros.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:31.549
302,596,096 parameters behind six numbers: fifty FiLM injectors, one per layer.

00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:34.913
0.91% of the checkpoint.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:42.905
0.708 s one 17-frame slice: the finest interval at which anything can change.

00:00:42.905 --> 00:00:45.015
No throughput figure published.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.770
Four of six axes now live.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:50.063
No frame exists until all of them do.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:57.358
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
